# Line added to the `hermes` user's crontab (`crontab -l -u hermes` on the
# VPS; `crontab -e` is the live source of truth, this repo cannot edit it).
# Kept here so a rebuild can restore it instead of silently losing the DNS
# channel probe (Task 3 / scripts/net_probe_dns.py).
#
# Runs every minute, writes the node_exporter textfile at
# NET_PROBE_DNS_OUTPUT (default /var/lib/hermes-metrics/net_probe_dns.prom).
# Uses the repo's own venv, not system python, because httpx is only
# installed there.

* * * * * /home/hermes/.hermes/hermes-agent/venv/bin/python /home/hermes/.hermes/scripts/net_probe_dns.py
